@TarefasApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5275

### 1) Health Check completo -> 200 OK com "status": "Healthy"
GET {{TarefasApi_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2) Liveness -> 200 OK com o texto "Healthy"
GET {{TarefasApi_HostAddress}}/health/live

### 3) Readiness -> 200 OK
GET {{TarefasApi_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### 4) POST valido -> 201 Created (confira o header Location)
POST {{TarefasApi_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Estudar OpenTelemetry",
  "descricao": "Rever a aula de metricas",
  "prioridade": "Alta",
  "dataConclusaoPrevista": "2026-12-20T00:00:00Z"
}

### 5) POST valido apenas com o parametro obrigatorio -> 201 Created
POST {{TarefasApi_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Comprar leite"
}

### 6) POST SEM TITULO -> 400 Bad Request (nunca 500)
POST {{TarefasApi_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "Esta tarefa nao tem titulo"
}

### 7) POST com titulo em branco -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{TarefasApi_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "   "
}

### 8) POST com JSON malformado -> 400 Bad Request (nunca 500)
POST {{TarefasApi_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas
Content-Type: application/json

{ isso nao e json }

### 9) GET listagem simples -> 200 OK
GET {{TarefasApi_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas
Accept: application/json

### 10) GET com parametros de filtro, ordenacao e paginacao -> 200 OK
GET {{TarefasApi_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas?prioridade=Alta&busca=estudar&ordenarPor=titulo&ordem=desc&pagina=1&tamanhoPagina=10
Accept: application/json

### 11) GET com parametro invalido -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{TarefasApi_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas?pagina=0

### 12) GET por id inexistente -> 404 Not Found
GET {{TarefasApi_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 13) Snapshot das metricas -> 200 OK
GET {{TarefasApi_HostAddress}}/metrics
Accept: application/json
